# Gaïa — environment (placeholders only, never put real secrets here).
#
# DATABASE_URL: Postgres connection string. For Supabase, use the pooler
# (Session mode, port 6543) or the direct connection (port 5432), e.g.:
#   DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.<ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
# The app enforces userId scoping in code (src/server/gaia.ts). Apply
# prisma/rls.sql in the Supabase SQL editor afterwards for defence in depth.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/gaia

# No other secret is needed: auth is an opaque random token in an httpOnly
# cookie, backed by the auth_sessions table (see src/server/session.ts).
# There is no NextAuth / OAuth secret in this app.
